# Acreline WordPress theme

Sage 11 WordPress **theme only** (`wp-content/themes/acreline`). **Theme Name:** Acreline. Repo: `matthummel-pa/wp-acreline`. WordPress core is not in this repo. The sample brokerage in the preview stays Acreline until Identity is changed.

Matt Hummel is the owner (marketer) and theme Author (`style.css` Author / Author URI: https://matthummel.com/). Prefer working in code. Keep copy editorial — rural farms, historic homes, and acreage in a **sample county** a buyer can rename — not generic luxury-broker voice and not a Gettysburg / Adams County-only brand story. Township filter **values** stay `Cumberland` / `Straban` / `Franklin`; labels are North Ridge / Mill Creek / Oak Hollow.

## Fiction only

Listings, agents, phones, emails, appointments, and market stats are **sample / concept**. Not a live MLS, licensed brokerage, or booking system.

- Phones: `555` numbers (office `(555) 010-0455`)
- Emails: `@acreline-concept.test`
- ZIPs / street numbers: fake (`00000`, Concept Way)
- Keep the site-wide “concept demo · fiction only” disclaimer
- Do not invent real people, real listings, or real licensed-agent claims

## Two surfaces

| Surface | What it is | How it updates |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Theme** | Blade, CSS, JS, PHP, field defaults | Merge to `main` → GitHub Action publishes `theme-latest` zip → **Appearance → Update Theme** on the host |
| **Content** | Pages, listings, agents, posts, `ks_*` meta, options | Lives in WordPress. Editing theme files does not change live posts |

Live concept site: https://acreline.matthummel.com/

CI **does not FTP** to the host. Do not assume a theme PR is live until the zip is installed.

## CSS that must not disappear

Card chrome is locked in `resources/css/card-lock.css` (imported last from `app.css`). White faces, thin `--shadow-rest`, no green bars, large grey tour-step numbers. Edit a component in `keystone.css` if you need layout — do not delete the lock, and do not re-open older PRs that rewrite the whole sheet from a pre-#23 `main`.

## Gutenberg (enabled)

Gutenberg is **on** for `page` and `post`. CPTs (`listing`, `booking`, `agent`) still use classic metaboxes.

- Custom blocks are registered in `app/blocks.php` and `resources/js/blocks/index.js`.
- Page copy fields migrated from `ks_*` meta into block attributes — do not recreate the old `ks_page_fields` metabox.
- Site-wide settings (phone, address, social, hours) remain in **Appearance → Customize → Identity**.
- Full-site editing (FSE) remains **off** (`remove_theme_support('block-templates')`).
- Custom block generator: **Tools → Block Generator** for no-code block creation.
- Migration tool: **Tools → Migrate to Blocks** converts legacy meta to block content.

## Do not

- Re-disable Gutenberg for `page` or `post` post types
- Treat this repo as a full WordPress install
- Put secrets in the theme. GitHub token lives in Customizer / `KS_GITHUB_TOKEN`, never commit it
- Document rare setup steps here — see `AGENTS.md` and `README.md`

Edit these rules when an agent repeats a mistake. Files in `.cursor/rules/` must stay `.mdc`.
